    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you choose this archetype at 3rd level, your new connection to death gives you the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You have advantage on saving throws against disease and against being poisoned, and you have resistance to poison damage.</p></li><li><p>You don’t need to eat, drink, or breathe.</p></li><li><p>You don’t need to sleep. When you take a long rest, you must spend at least 4 hours in an inactive, motionless state instead of sleeping. In this state, you remain semiconscious and can hear as normal.</p></li></ul><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-4rFiji9g1DKh5Urr\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The resistance to poison damage is automated. Roll the saving throws against disease and against being poisoned with advantage yourself.</p></section>",
